      "contextHtml": "<div>\n        <div>\n          <span>C</span>\n          <div>\n            <h3>C. READING (2.6 points)</h3>\n            <p>Đọc điền từ vào đoạn văn &amp; Đọc hiểu chi tiết</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <span>10 câu • 2.6 đ</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- I. Cloze reading -->\n      <div>\n        <div>\n          <h4>\n            <span>I.</span> Circle the best answer A, B, C or D to complete the passage. (1.0 pt)\n          </h4>\n          <u>\n            <i></i> Nghe đoạn văn\n          </u>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          \"In England, when the school children come to school, they first go to the cloakroom. They take off their coats and raincoats, their caps and hats, and then go to <strong>(1)______</strong> classroom. Some of the students go to the laboratories and workshops where they <strong>(2)______</strong> physics, chemistry and art. When a student is on duty, he come to <strong>(3)______</strong> very early. He has to open <strong>(4)______</strong> the windows, water the flowers and clean the blackboard, so everything is ready for the first lesson. <strong>(5)_______</strong> seven thirty, the teacher comes into the room and the lesson begins.\"\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 5 Cloze Questions -->\n        <div>\n          <!-- RC1 -->\n          \n\n          <!-- RC2 -->\n          \n\n          <!-- RC3 -->\n          \n\n          <!-- RC4 -->\n          \n\n          <!-- RC5 -->\n          \n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <div>\n          <h4>\n            <span>II.</span> Read the passage, then answer the questions. (1.6 pt)\n          </h4>\n          <u>\n            <i></i> Nghe bài đọc Lan &amp; Mi\n          </u>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <p>\n            \"My name's Lan. My best friend is Mi. She's 12 years old, like me! She has brown hair and brown eyes. Her favourite colour is blue. That's my favourite colour, too. She likes roller skating and cycling in summer. She has a dog called Tuti. I think that's a funny name!\"\n          </p>\n          <p>\n            \"Mi is really nice. She is very funny. She makes me laugh a lot. She tells good jokes. Mi helps me in my lessons because sometimes I don't understand everything. We meet after school and do our homework together. We have a lot of fun. She's a good friend. She's always there for me. She understands my feelings and she cheers me up when I'm sad.\"\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 5 Comprehension Questions (All Multiple-Choice for phone convenience) -->\n        <div>\n          <!-- R2_1 -->\n          \n\n          <!-- R2_2 -->\n          \n\n          <!-- R2_3 (Transformed from question: How old is Mi?) -->\n          \n\n          <!-- R2_4 (Transformed from question: What is her favourite colour?) -->\n          \n\n          <!-- R2_5 (Transformed from question: Does Mi cheer Lan up when she’s sad?) -->\n          \n        </div>\n      </div>"
